    "status": "PROVED",
    "closure": "proof",
    "statement": "For every fixed P,E, all maximal-sunflower residuals with polarized entropy p<=P and defect d<=ell+E are polynomially bounded. Every such word automatically satisfies G_2<=2P or G_R<=P: for ell>P, two dense petals give G_2<=p, while exactly one dense petal gives G_R<=p by the threshold and per-petal cap. Hence an unpaid family must escape every fixed box through p unbounded or d-ell unbounded.",
